{
  "key": 39291,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "HearthomeGym_Text_FantinaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{SIZE 200}Ohohoho!!{SIZE 100}\r",
        "Finally, you have arrived!\r",
        "Since I came to this country, always\n",
        "I try to learn new things.\r",
        "They hold Contests in this city?\n",
        "I say to myself, enfin, I will excel.\r",
        "That is why I dress this way.\n",
        "C’est une performance!\r",
        "Also, I study Pokémon very much.\n",
        "I have come to be Gym Leader.\r",
        "And, uh, so it shall be that you\n",
        "challenge me.\r",
        "But I shall win.\n",
        "That is what a Gym Leader does, non?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{SIZE 200}Ohohoho!!!{SIZE 100}\r",
        "Enfin, te voilà darling!\r",
        "Depuis mon arrivée dans ce country, \n",
        "j’essaie de progresser chaque jour.\r",
        "Ils font Concours dans cette ville?\n",
        "Je me dis, marvellous, je vais gagner.\r",
        "C’est pourquoi j’ai choisi cet habit.\n",
        "C’est paillettes, show business!\r",
        "Sinon, j’étudie Pokémon très dur.\n",
        "J’ai réussi devenir Champion d’Arène.\r",
        "Et, euh, on dirait que tu veux\n",
        "me défier.\r",
        "Mais je remporterai la victory. C’est le\n",
        "travail du Champion d’Arène, isn’t it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeGym_Text_BeatFantina",
      "en_US": [
        "I am dumbfounded!\r",
        "So very, very strong!\n",
        "You, your Pokémon, so strong!\r",
        "Your power is admirable!\n",
        "I shall honor it with this Gym Badge!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis stupéfied!\r",
        "Vraiment, très, très fort!\n",
        "Toi, tes Pokémon, very étonnants!\r",
        "Une puissance gigantic!\n",
        "Tu as bien mérité ce Badge d’Arène!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeGym_Text_FantinaReceiveRelicBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Relic Badge from Fantina!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient le\n",
        "Badge Fantôme de Kiméra!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeGym_Text_FantinaExplainRelicBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "That Badge will let you use the\n",
        "hidden move Defog outside of battle.\r",
        "Also, you can make use of this\n",
        "Technical Machine.\r",
        "That is what I think.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Grâce à ce Badge, tes Pokémon peuvent\n",
        "utiliser le capacité Anti-Brume, hors\f",
        "combat, now.\r",
        "Tu peux also te servir de\n",
        "cette Capsule Technique.\r",
        "Je dis, il sera très utile à toi.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeGym_FantinaExplainTM65",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}...\n",
        "It contains {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "A very startling move it is.\n",
        "Its hits turn critical often!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}...\n",
        "Elle contient {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "C’est une capacité très frightening.\n",
        "Lots of coups critiques!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeGym_Text_FantinaAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Three Gym Badges...\r",
        "But you must not forget this.\n",
        "There are many other Trainers.\r",
        "Strong Trainers, too.\n",
        "There are many more in Sinnoh.\r",
        "Have patience! You must become\n",
        "stronger, one at a time."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Trois Badges d’Arène...\r",
        "Mais n’oublie pas ça.\n",
        "Il y a beaucoup autres Dresseurs.\r",
        "Dresseurs very coriaces, aussi.\n",
        "Ils sont nombreux dans Sinnoh.\r",
        "Patience et persévérance. Chaque\n",
        "chose en son time."
      ]
    },
